{"repositoryId":1146228564,"availability":"available","full":"ashishgogula/coverflow","name":"coverflow","description":"iOS-like Cover Flow for React. Fluid, physical motion with zero layout shifts. Built with Motion and Tailwind. Part of Planes · useplanes.com","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":145,"forks":3,"created":"2026-01-30T19:45:30Z","updated":"2026-09-20T16:07:51Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://coverflow.ashishgogula.in/","topics":["animation","interaction-design","motion-design","react","shadcn-ui","ui-components"],"demo":"https://coverflow.ashishgogula.in/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:48.612Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:48.612Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:48.612Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T11:49:48.612Z","stars":145,"forks":3}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A high-fidelity recreation of the classic iTunes Cover Flow interaction — an iOS-style coverflow carousel component for React, built for the modern web with Next.js, Tailwind and Motion.","This project focuses on motion feel, spatial depth, and interaction fidelity rather than recreating visuals pixel-for-pixel.","If this component helped you or inspired an interaction idea, a GitHub star is appreciated."],"features":["Supports click, drag, touch, keyboard, and horizontal wheel interactions with velocity-aware dragging and arrow-key navigation.","Driven by motion springs for weighty, responsive, and fully interruptible animations.","Uses hardware-accelerated CSS 3D transforms for smooth, refresh-rate-independent performance.","Drops cleanly into shadcn-based projects via the CLI or manual install, following the same conventions and structure.","Works seamlessly in modern React and Next.js environments, including App Router setups."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ashishgogula/coverflow/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"900503b941b9e2b39e5ca8be